            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5116DL高压单段线性恒流 LED 控制芯片"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                90,
                46,
                480,
                99
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "概述"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                90,
                121,
                137,
                140
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5116DL 是一款高精度的单段线性恒流 LED 控制芯片，集成了高压 MOS管和 JFET 高压供电功能。主要用于驱动由市电供电的高电压、低电流 LED 灯串。由于不需要磁性元件，LED 驱动器可以实现小体积、长寿命，并符合 EMI规定。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                89,
                153,
                485,
                250
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5116DL 可以通过外部电阻精确的设定 LED 电流。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                90,
                259,
                445,
                275
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5116DL 具有过温调节功能。当输入电压过高，或者 LED电流过大时，此功能将降低输出电流。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                90,
                285,
                484,
                322
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/44497bbc0d54eff3f90617ea137028f27afbef41bb323c5e5a9fbf6a31d0e065.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
