        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/71d79eb030ab2299d37d0b0e2e2a7b8cf8fc92fdea62c1b5b18b823d6642e5a4.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "image_caption": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "图 3 BP5116DL 部框图"
                    }
                ],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                126,
                892,
                451
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "应用信息"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                100,
                506,
                188,
                525
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5116DL 是一款高精度单段线性恒流 LED 控制芯片，主要用于驱动由市电供电的高电压、低电流 LED 灯串。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                538,
                475,
                575
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1 供电"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                100,
                588,
                154,
                604
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "在系统上电后，D 端通过内部的高压 JFET 给芯片供电，当 D 端的电压超过 10V 之后芯片开始工作。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                617,
                473,
                653
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2 恒流控制，输出电流设置"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                100,
                667,
                289,
                683
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5116DL 可以通过外部电阻精确设定 LED 电流。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                100,
                696,
                436,
                712
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "LED 导通时，输出电流计算公式："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                726,
                324,
                741
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "I _ {L E D} = \\frac {V r e f}{R c s}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/5b1f76d0b2b6733388316111e71e61faa04c1d46b603d6b00213ea3b9459bb91.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                174,
                751,
                273,
                787
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "由于散热能力的限制，在 220V 市电输入时，建议将 LED电流设在 40mA 以下；在 110V 市电输入时，建议将 LED电流设在 80mA 以下。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                793,
                484,
                848
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3 过温调节功能"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                514,
                501,
                623,
                517
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5116DL 具有过热调节功能，在驱动电源过热时逐渐减小输出电流，从而控制输出功率和温升，使电源温度保持在设定值，以提高系统的可靠性。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                531,
                897,
                588
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "过热调节温度为芯片内部设定值(参照电气参数表)。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                600,
                852,
                615
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "PCB 设计"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                630,
                584,
                645
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "在设计 BP5116DL 的 PCB 板时，需要注意以下事项："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                659,
                870,
                675
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "地线"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                514,
                689,
                549,
                703
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "电流采样电阻的功率地线尽可能短。GND 的面积要尽可能大，以减小热阻，增强散热能力。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                719,
                897,
                755
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "芯片散热片"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                768,
                594,
                784
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5116DL 芯片底部有增强散热能力的散热片，在芯片内部已经连接到 GND 引脚。在设计 PCB 时，将散热片连接到 PCB 的地。为了达到良好的散热效果，需要将散热片连接的 PCB 铜皮面积尽量大。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                510,
                797,
                897,
                875
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                885,
                954,
                895,
                965
